OL,3,GNEWSAPlans submitted for new roundabout
OL,4,Aon A-road
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to redevelop a business park
OL,7,Fwhich it is claimed could create more
OL,8,Fthan 1,600 jobs have been submitted.
OL,10,FJaynic wants to redevelop the
OL,11,F36.80-hectare site at Shepherds Grove
OL,12,Fat Stanton, near Bury St Edmunds.
OL,14,FThe scheme, submitted to West Suffolk
OL,15,FCouncil, would create up to 105,000 sq
OL,16,Fmetres of floorspace spanning a variety
OL,17,Fof uses, including offices,
OL,18,Fmanufacturing and distribution. The
OL,19,Fcurrent application is for a new
OL,20,Froundabout for the site, which is off
OL,21,Fthe A143, an internal spine road
OL,22,Fthrough the park and landscaping.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
